+and arbitrary variable renaming preserve the represented problem. From the
+clause blocks the key recovers the cycle graph (adjacent pairs occur in two
+triple windows), reads the parity word around it, and chooses its least cyclic
+rotation over both orientations. Thus the key ignores all named labels while
+retaining the complete cyclic right-hand-side pattern. selftest applies the
