codex
Completed and verified the Track B problem generator based on the paper’s SAT-to-SMP construction ([arXiv paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1604.01757)).

Key results:

- Shipping preset: \(n=100\), 250 decoys, \(2^{100}\) candidate space.
- All gates G1–G9 pass.
- Bare oracle pool: 0/3 solved.
- Structurally hinted pool: 0/3 solved.
- Placebo diagnostic: 1/3 solved.
- Reference elimination: 165,273 bit-XORs per instance on average.
- Compact route: 119 search nodes and 299 XORs.
- Standard-library-only implementation.

Deliverables:

- [gen_1604_01757.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1604.01757/gen_1604_01757.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1604.01757/selftest_report.json)
